,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitejs/vite/pulls/24152","html_url":"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/pull/24152","diff_url":"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/pull/24152.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/pull/24152.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #21277\n\n### Description\n\n`import x from \"./data.txt?url&raw\"` works at runtime (the asset plugin's `?raw` handler reads the file and returns its content as a string), but `packages/vite/client.d.ts` only declared `*`?raw`, `*`?url`, `*`?url&inline` and `*`?url&no-inline` — so IDEs and `tsc` reported `Cannot find module './data.txt?url&raw'`.\n\nThis PR adds the missing `declare module '*?url&raw'` (typed as `string`, matching `*`?raw`) plus a regression test that type-checks a `?url&raw` fixture with the repo's own `tsc` (`--noEmit`): it fails with `error TS2307` on the old `client.d.ts` and passes with the fix.\n\n### Tests\n\n- New test `packages/vite/src/node/__tests__/clientTypes.spec.ts`: 1 passed\n- `packages/vite/src/node/__tests__` full suite: 874 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed\n- `pnpm run build` (incl. tsc check) green; oxfmt/oxlint clean on the changed files\n\nThank you for reviewing!","closed_by":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com